lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="51" y="223" w="51" h="17"/></label><label labelid="5" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="5" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="41" y="14"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>41</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>96</x><y>24</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Escocia&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="37" y="15" w="59" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Águila pescadora&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="2" sequence="3"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las ballenas jorobadas pasan el verano en las aguas heladas del Ártico y la Antártida. En invierno, las ballenas recorren unos 5.000 kilómetros hacia el ecuador, donde dan a luz en las aguas cálidas. Cuando las crías son lo suficientemente mayores, las ballenas realizan el viaje de vuelta a su ‘casa de verano’.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Ballena jorobada&lt;/html&gt;</title><image>0016ed6e_whale.jpg</image><imagerefid>25A4088F</imagerefid></caption><image>0016ed6e_3.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="6" y="379"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Haz clic en una foto para ver otra ruta migratoria &lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="2" y="380" w="324" h="16"/></label><label labelid="1" action="newSlide" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="0" y="0"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>311</y></point><point><x>105</x><y>309</y></point><point><x>102</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>378</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>311</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext/><audiorefid/><bgrct x="-4" y="1" w="5" h="-1"/></label><label labelid="2" action="newSlide" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="0" y="0"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>315</x><y>308</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>310</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>379</y></point><point><x>315</x><y>379</y></point><point><x>315</x><y>308</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext/><audiorefid/><bgrct x="-4" y="1" w="5" h="-1"/></label><label labelid="3" action="newSlide" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="0" y="0"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>107</x><y>309</y></point><point><x>207</x><y>310</y></point><point><x>208</x><y>378</y></point><point><x>108</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>107</x><y>309</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext/><audiorefid/><bgrct x="-4" y="1" w="5" h="-1"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Ballena jorobada&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="4" sequence="4"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Los charranes árticos son aves marinas que pasan el verano en el Ártico.  En otoño realizan un largo viaje. Recorren unos 16.000 kilómetros hasta llegar a la Antártida. &lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Charrán ártico&lt;/html&gt;</title><image>0016ed6e_tern.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B82760D</imagerefid></caption><image>0016ed6e_4.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="6" y="379"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Haz clic en una foto para ver otra ruta migratoria&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="2" y="380" w="320" h="16"/></label><label labelid="1" action="newSlide" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="0"